    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1744442879\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna and the Sea</strong> is a beautifully hand-drawn-style, story-driven <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong> set in <strong>17th-century Amsterdam</strong>. You play as <strong>Luna</strong>, a young girl surviving alone on the streets, who embarks on a journey across the sea to find her long-lost father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only her wits and kindness, Luna navigates a world that is both cruel and wondrous, encountering characters who are struggling just like her. Every choice matters\u2014will you help those in need, or look out only for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter introduces players to Luna\u2019s world, where <strong>puzzles, exploration, and heartfelt storytelling</strong> blend seamlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich narrative adventure</strong> \u2013 Experience a heartwarming yet bittersweet story about hope, loss, and resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles, interact with unique characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583780/extras/5d101b8b7f8e9ab7d2a4e363a1daac10.avif?t=1744442879\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luna and the Sea</strong> is a beautifully hand-drawn-style, story-driven <strong>point-and-click adventure</strong> set in <strong>17th-century Amsterdam</strong>. You play as <strong>Luna</strong>, a young girl surviving alone on the streets, who embarks on a journey across the sea to find her long-lost father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only her wits and kindness, Luna navigates a world that is both cruel and wondrous, encountering characters who are struggling just like her. Every choice matters\u2014will you help those in need, or look out only for yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first chapter introduces players to Luna\u2019s world, where <strong>puzzles, exploration, and heartfelt storytelling</strong> blend seamlessly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A rich narrative adventure</strong> \u2013 Experience a heartwarming yet bittersweet story about hope, loss, and resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles, interact with unique characters, and explore a historically inspired setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn art style</strong> \u2013 A visually distinctive, pencil-drawn world that feels like stepping into a child\u2019s dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s interactions shape her journey, rewarding kindness and cleverness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic hint system</strong> \u2013 Luna\u2019s only friend, the <strong>moon</strong>, gently guides her when she\u2019s lost.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hand-drawn-style point-and-click adventure set in 17th-century Amsterdam. Play as Luna, a young girl surviving on the streets, solving puzzles, and embarking on a journey to find her father. A touching story about kindness, resilience, and the sea.",
